          "judge": "cli-proxy/gpt-5.6-luna",
          "quote_span": "“We have cases of men being forcibly mobilised, despite a formal deferral. While travelling in Ukraine, they are stopped at a checkpoint for a document check and told that their records need to be clarified. On this pretext, they are taken to the local TCK. Their information in the electronic military registration system is altered: their deferral disappears from the system and they are registered for military service in the district where they were stopped, despite not residing there, which is unlawful.”",
